.research/260720_compile-only-build-drivers.md:609:The driver identifier is versioned (`go-v1`), so any change to command arguments, environment, sandbox-relevant semantics, receipt interpretation, or output rules requires a new driver identifier or an explicitly versioned cache-key policy revision.
